ted 0 3cm from the black posterior margin  up to 0 2cm from the green medial margin  up to 0 4cm from the blue anterior margin  and is located 0 3cm from the superior margin and reaches the inferior margin  The specimen is entirely submitted from superior to inferior  with the superior and inferior margins submitted en face in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  Received in formalin and labeled Mone  Margaret  REMOVE_MRN and  final margin right breast   are 4 fragments of fibrofatty tissue aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  unoriented  submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Breast  Right   Re Excision PART B  Breast  Right  Final Margin   Excision  report_end  , Primary.
