eceptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  28 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 11 26 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of breast tissue  inked and sectioned to reveal a  8cm irregular  firm nodule within 0 1cm from the inked resection margin  The nodule is submitted entirely in cassette A through C and representative sections of the remaining breast tissue in cassettes D through E  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  CLOSE TO MARGIN  O R  Resident  HENRY DONG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  EXCISION   report_end  , Diagnosis_(only_if_excisional_biopsy).
