D_DATE x 1 0cm fibroadipose tissue fragment with a localization needle  There is a long stitch designating the lateral and a short stitch designating the deep resection margins  The specimen is inked as follows  superior black  inferior blue  deep orange  anterior red  medial yellow  and lateral green  The specimen is sectioned from anterior to posterior to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm ill defined tan firm mass  predomiantly in the anterior medial aspect of the specimen abutting the medial resection margin  It is 0 3cm from the superior margin  0 6cm from the inferior margin  0 7cm from the lateral margin  approximately 0 3cm from the anterior margin  1 3cm from the deep resection margin  The remaining specimen is predominantly yellow and fatty  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes H R as follows  H  anterior margin enface  I  deep margin enface  J R  remaining specimen from anterior to posterior  N and O belong to the same section  Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Suzanne J Koven  M D  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT LATERAL   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT SUPERIOR   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Diagnosis_(only_if_excisional_biopsy).
