ateral and anterior margins  Representative sections are submitted from anterior to posterior as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion to inferior and medial margins  including tissue containing clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion to inferior and medial margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion to inferior and lateral margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion to inferior and medial margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue between lesion and 2nd nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire posterior nodule to closest margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior margin  radial  Received fresh  labeled  final margin medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm portion of fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right superior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm aggregate of tan pink fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right final lateral margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  final margin inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of gray to tan red fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1   FX 1A   RIGHT AXILLA SENTINEL NODES   CARCINOMA NOT IDENTIFIED ON THE FROZEN SECTION  AWAIT SENTINEL NODE WORKUP  Final Diagnosis by Thomas Gudewicz M D   Electronically signed on Monday REMOVED_MONTH 07   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 10 23 43AM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or