ed  right breast inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm unoriented portion of yellow tan breast parenchyma with a guide wire localizing a firm region  The outer surface of the specimen is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm ill defined fibrous region next to the guide wire that abuts the black inked margin  The entire specimen is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the fibrous region in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right breast superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm portion of yellow tan breast tissue that is unoriented and contains a guide wire localizing a firm region  The outer portion of the specimen is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm ill defined white tan fibrous region that abuts the inked margin  The entire specimen is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the fibrous region in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received are an additional five containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received in formalin  labeled  right breast inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of yellow tan soft tissue with a stitch designating one aspect  The stitched aspect is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal no masses or lesions  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right breast deep   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm portion of yellow tan soft tissue with two stitches designating one aspect  The opposing aspect is white tan fibrous tissue with focal hemorrhage  The stitched end is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal fibrocystic change that abuts the inked margin  The specimen is submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right breast lateral   are two portions of yellow tan soft tissue with a stitch designating one 