ed the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  12 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 07 34 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast  are three fragments of fiboradipose tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  respectively  The largest portion is sectioned to reveal no discrete lesions and is submitted in its entirety in cassettes A   C  The second portion  upon sectioning contains an ill defined  firm white nodule  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm which extends to within 0 1cm from the margin  The second portion is submitted in its entirety in cassettes D and E  The smallest portion is sectioned to reveal no discrete lesions and is submitted entirely in cassette F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  LEFT BREAST  SMALL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Ross C  Wheeler  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Primary_(If_case_diagnosed).
