nely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  19 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 11 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  in two parts  Labeled  left breast and axilla  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm oriented left modified radical mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating the 12 o clock position  The specimen includes a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm axillary tail  Overlying the specimen is a REMOVED_DATE x 9 0cm skin ellipse  with a REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm nipple alveolar complex  located 2 8cm from the 12 o clock skin margin  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm tan white  stellate  firm mass located in the upper outer quadrant  extending to within 0 2cm of the closest deep resection margin  and 1 5cm from the closest 2 o clock soft tissue margin  The mass extends to the base of the axillary tail  Apart from this mass  the remaining parenchyma shows a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  tan  fibrotic  rubbery  ill defined area  located in the upper inner quadrant  6 0cm from the 11 o clock margin  and 1 0cm from the closest deep margin  The axillary tail is dissected to reveal multiple lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  The largest lymph node contains a firm  tan white cut surface  Section code  A  nipple B D tumor with deep resection margin E H tumor  representative sections I K fibrotic area L R lymph nodes Labeled  additional anterior margin  left  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable tan yellow  soft breast parenchyma  Entirely submitted in S W  Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Barbara Ann Penn  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  ADDITIONAL ANTERIOR MARGINS  LEFT    report_end  , Primary_(If_case_diagnosed).
