eived fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 1cm oriented fragment of yellow fibrofatty tissue with a short suture denoting the superior margin and a long suture denoting the lateral margin  and a silver needle localization wire in place  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  superior green and inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal predominantly tan white and firm fibrous tissue with scant intervening yellow fibrofatty tissue  No nodules or calcifications are identified grossly  Representative sections are sequentially submitted from the lateral end to the medial end in cassettes A J  Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Sarah P Thayer  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Diagnosis_(only_if_excisional_biopsy).
